        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86128, Traditional Spindle Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Spindle Cabinet Pull is available in a huge array of colors. Choose between stunning classic finishes and modern beauties. The Traditional Spindle Cabinet Pull is available in 4 sizes. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware. The Emtek Spindle Pull is made of high quality brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Spindle Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86128-specifications.pdf?v=1704262412\"><b>Emtek Spindle Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86128:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86129:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86130:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86248:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-9-finish.jpg?v=1704354579\" width=\"597\" height=\"89\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
